## Additional Notice — Intentional Vulnerabilities

The challenge binaries, web applications, and scripts in this repository are
**intentionally vulnerable** for educational and CTF training purposes only.
They must NOT be deployed in production environments or on public infrastructure
without proper isolation (e.g., Docker sandboxing).

The authors take no responsibility for misuse of the techniques demonstrated
in these challenges.
